      "text": "In order to encourage greater participation by small and\nminority-owned businesses in City construction projects, I\nhereby instruct all agency heads, pursuant to a recently adopted\namendment to the Board of Estimate Rules and Regulations govern-\ning construction contracts, to dispense with the requirement of\nperformance and payment bonds on construction contracts of less\nthan $50,000, unless posting of such bond is absolutely critical\nto the protection of the interests of the City of New York.",
